WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:18.192
It was a hot day at the beach.

2
00:00:18.193 --> 00:00:24.051
"I need to cool off," said Bird.

3
00:00:24.052 --> 00:00:31.628
"Me too!" said Kip.

4
00:00:31.629 --> 00:00:35.275
Kip saw a big red box.

5
00:00:35.276 --> 00:00:38.757
"I wonder what's in there," he said.

6
00:00:38.758 --> 00:00:45.858
"I'll look in and see," said Bird.

7
00:00:45.859 --> 00:00:49.268
Bird flew over the box.

8
00:00:49.269 --> 00:00:52.209
"Ice cubes!" she cried.

9
00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:55.647
"There are ice cubes in the box!"

10
00:00:55.648 --> 00:00:58.351
Bird flew into the box.

11
00:00:58.352 --> 00:01:07.797
Kip climbed up the side of the box.

12
00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:10.410
He jumped into the ice.

13
00:01:10.411 --> 00:01:14.071
Kip went under the ice.

14
00:01:14.072 --> 00:01:17.582
He popped back out.

15
00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:20.199
"Brr!" said Kip.

16
00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.423
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed.

17
00:01:22.424 --> 00:01:27.095
"Ah, this ice feels great!" said Kip.

18
00:01:27.096 --> 00:01:29.126
"Yep," said Bird.

19
00:01:29.127 --> 00:01:32.483
"It doesn't get any better than this."

20
00:01:32.484 --> 00:01:34.848
"Hey!" yelled a man.

21
00:01:34.849 --> 00:01:38.852
"There's a bird and chipmunk in the cooler!"

22
00:01:38.853 --> 00:01:45.625
Bird and Kip escaped fast.

23
00:01:45.626 --> 00:01:48.812
"That was fun!" said Bird.

24
00:01:48.813 --> 00:01:53.726
"Yes," said Kip.

25
00:01:53.727 --> 00:02:00.862
"But I'm still hot!"
